OL,3,APutin shows no sign of stopping the war
OL,4,Aas Russia doubles down on Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Vladimir Putin arrived to address
OL,7,FRussia's parliament on Wednesday, a
OL,8,Fwarm welcome was guaranteed.
OL,10,F"The Special Election Operation", as
OL,11,Fone Russian newspaper dubbed last
OL,12,Fmonth's legislative vote, has produced
OL,13,Fa State Duma even more pro-Putin than
OL,14,Fanything before it.
OL,16,FThe ruling party, United Russia, now
OL,17,Fhas more MPs than ever.
OL,19,FIt allows the Kremlin to claim it has
OL,20,Fbeen handed a huge mandate from the
OL,21,FRussian people.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
